# Shadcn-ui (reference document)
- When this rule is mentioned, first open and read the official page: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs
- Follow the page over your prior knowledge. If you cannot open it, say so and ask me to paste the relevant section.
- Key facts:
  - Add components with npx shadcn@latest add followed by the component name (e.g., npx shadcn@latest add button).
  - Import components from @/components/ui/*.





